Ben L: suggestion: "Avoid returning top-level arrays; prefer an explicit envelope (`envelope_type` + `entries`) to ensure deterministic parser behavior."

Noor A: conciser: "Prefer an explicit envelope (`envelope_type` + `entries`) over top-level arrays to avoid parser ambiguity."

